WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.840
What happens when SCP-914&nbsp;
gets in the Halloween spirit?&nbsp;

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:09.840
Intern Snevets prepared one plastic skeleton, one&nbsp;
Freddy Krueger animatronic Halloween decoration,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:14.700
and a variety of assorted Halloween-themed&nbsp;
baked goods for experimentation. All of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.060
above items were placed into the&nbsp;
Clockworks on the setting "Fine."

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:23.280
The output produced was a humanoid animatronic,&nbsp;
designed to look like a generic baker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:28.500
possessing a cognitohazardous effect causing the&nbsp;
viewer to believe that a recent baking competition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:34.440
(later found to have not actually occurred) was&nbsp;
won by a team made up of nine heavily mutilated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:40.140
corpses. This effect did not prevent the viewer&nbsp;
from realizing how unusual such an event would be.

